OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council begins fresh
OL,4,Apay talks with union and Gilruth
OL,5,
OL,6,FFresh talks between Glasgow City
OL,7,FCouncil, the Unison union and the
OL,8,Fdeputy first minister have begun just
OL,9,Fhours after negotiations appeared to
OL,10,Fcollapse again.
OL,12,FTalks over a controversial pay
OL,13,Fregrading system have been ongoing
OL,14,Fafter the council agreed on Friday to
OL,15,Fpause its plan to fire and rehire
OL,16,F23,000 workers under new terms.
OL,18,FThe new pay system would replace one
OL,19,Ffound to discriminate against mainly
OL,20,Fwomen workers, but it would leave about
OL,21,F11% of staff worse off, with some
OL,22,Flosing #11,000 a year.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
