OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council begins fresh
OL,4,Apay talks with union and Gilruth
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday night, a council statement
OL,7,Fsaid talks had broken down and
OL,8,Fsuggested Unison members could now face
OL,9,Fbeing sent letters over fire and
OL,10,Frehire.
